From: Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: configure WA for CT WED transmit offload

Advertise the TX-only WED capability to WA after firmware download.
Connac2 owns the separate receive path, so no native WED receive
capability is advertised and native WED RED configuration is unchanged.

--- a/mt7915/mcu.c
+++ b/mt7915/mcu.c
@@ -2463,2 +2463,10 @@ int mt7915_mcu_init_firmware(struct mt7915_dev *dev)
+#ifdef CONFIG_MT7915_NPU
+	if (mt7915_ct_wed_active(dev)) {
+		ret = mt7915_mcu_wa_cmd(dev, MCU_WA_PARAM_CMD(CAPABILITY), 0, 0, 0);
+		if (ret)
+			return ret;
+	}
+#endif
+
 #if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_NET_MEDIATEK_SOC_WED)
 	if (mtk_wed_device_active(&dev->mt76.mmio.wed)) {
